# Landfall is a trigger that goes on the stack: with the Hydra's ability waiting, Bot2 destroys the Hydra in response (Get Lost).
# The ability resolves and does nothing - it cannot put counters on a creature that is no longer on the battlefield - and the
# Hydra is in Bot1's graveyard (as a new object it has no counters). Bot1 gets two Map tokens.

